cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, experimental framework, or benchmark artifacts, please cite it as below."
title: "ProRAG-FL: Blockchain-Anchored Provenance-Aware Retrieval-Augmented Federated Intrusion Detection for Cloud-IoT Systems"
abstract: "ProRAG-FL introduces a three-tier decoupled trust architecture resolving model, knowledge, and decision trust for Cloud-IoT federated intrusion detection. Incorporates locked 1D-CNN backbone, temperature scaling calibration, class-conditional Mahalanobis OOD detection, Hyperledger Fabric provenance validation, deterministic Merkle knowledge integrity, hybrid BGE-M3/BM25 retrieval with 6-check Hard Provenance Filtering, and structured LLM incident reporting."
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-28
license: Apache-2.0
